// CRE Grade 7 depth pass (18 Nov 2026). The first pass gave every misconception one stock cause, a repair equal to the child's
// line, and many examples whose wrong answer no child would pick ("God is weak", "Water" as a drug). Each now has a real error,
// an example a Grade 7 learner might really choose, the learner's reason and a repair. One new skill (teachings on money and true
// riches, from the scriptures the KICD design names), more outcomes on existing skills, prerequisites to Grade 5-6 skills, a fourth
// misconception for every skill and the teaching pack. Merged by scripts/build-cre-grade.mjs 7. Draft until a CRE teacher reviews it.
