    pack: P('The learner narrates Luke 2:41-52: at twelve Jesus goes to Jerusalem for the Passover, stays behind, is found after three days among the teachers listening and asking questions, says he must be in his Father\'s house, goes home and obeys his parents; values: obedience, love for God\'s word, wisdom.',
      ['Knows Jesus was dedicated in the temple.', 'Who praised God holding baby Jesus?', 'Simeon'],
      ['a road from Jerusalem to Nazareth drawn', 'Luke 2:49 and 2:51 on cards', 'a values list'],
      ['Passover in Jerusalem at twelve.', 'Jesus stays behind.', 'Found after three days with the teachers.', 'Goes home and obeys his parents.'],
      ['a young person asking questions in Bible study', 'obeying parents', 'a family trip to the city'],
      B('Draw the temple with teachers sitting and a boy among them.', 'Point at the boy.', 'What was Jesus doing with the teachers?', 'Wait for the learner to say listening and asking questions.', 'List the values from the story.'),
      [['How old was Jesus when he stayed in the temple?', 'Twelve', 'age'], ['What did Jesus do after being found?', 'Went home and obeyed his parents', 'obedience']]),
