      M_CR7_CS_BARRIER: M('The learner does not know what a barrier means.', 'Explain barrier as something that blocks; list poverty, distance, insecurity, few workers, language.', 'Names having enough workers as a barrier to mission work, mixing barriers with strengths.'),
