      M_CR7_MF_VALUE: M('The learner picks a word without thinking how it works in a home.', 'For each value, give a family scene that shows it.', 'Picks keeping secrets from each other as a value that keeps families stable, instead of love, honesty and forgiveness.', 'Which value keeps a family stable?', 'Keeping secrets from each other', 'Love, honesty and forgiveness'),
